OL,3,GNEWSAMan City TV presenter's
OL,4,A'terrifying' stalker ordeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football presenter has described a
OL,7,F"terrifying" eight-month ordeal in
OL,8,Fwhich her stalker turned up at a
OL,9,FPremier League match where she was
OL,10,Fworking.
OL,12,FFormer BBC Radio Manchester presenter
OL,13,FNatalie Pike said the man was arrested
OL,14,Fafter she recognised him while she was
OL,15,Fbroadcasting at Etihad Stadium before
OL,16,FManchester City played Newcastle United
OL,17,Fin February.
OL,19,FMs Pike, who covered Scotland during
OL,20,Fthe World Cup in the United States this
OL,21,Fsummer, now works as City's in-house
OL,22,Fpresenter as well as on other channels.
